--- design summary ---
3 MAC compute units (32-bit signed, register accumulator)
3 independent rate-enable counters (single PLL, three sub-rates):
  vision_en   pulses 1/8,333,333  cycles ≈ 30  Hz
  language_en pulses 1/250,000,000 cycles ≈ 1   Hz
  action_en   pulses 1/2,500,000  cycles ≈ 100 Hz
2 AXI-Stream FIFOs (distributed-RAM, async-read):
  vision  -> attn   : depth 64
  attn    -> action : depth 8
1 primary clock, no PLL/MMCM instantiated (clock arrives on port, OOC synth).

