--- SUB-LINEAR AREA CHECK (per task ask [c]) ---
The 3 MAC units use 3 DSP58 → linear in DSP. Acceptable: each MAC is independent
(no shared multiplier or pipelined fabric). The "sub-linear" win comes elsewhere
in the topology — sharing one PLL/clock tree, one reset tree, and one global
infrastructure costs ~0 incremental as we grow MAC count, vs ~3x of those
overheads if we'd used three separate PLLs.

